Cell["\<\
A substrate is the graph a construction runs on. Every figure in this \
documentation is drawn on one, so an example starts with one line and no \
setup code.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"06d40ee7-ec5b-4c6b-bb42-65e2576b11c4"],

Cell["The roster has five classes:", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"b4013e5f-9aba-4cb7-b4d7-7cb20e254212"],

